                    "[Ultimate] Buff -> While canted rechamber time is decreased from 1.2s to 1.1s",
                    "[Ultimate] Buff -> While canted ADS time reduced from 0.5s to 0.4s",
                    "[Ultimate] Adjust -> Bullet scaling is drastically reduced in Canted sights (so be accurate!)",
                    "[Ultimate] Buff -> Increase aiming responsiveness with Normal sight",
                    "[Ultimate] Buff -> Reduced ADS time from 0.6s to 0.5s",
                    "[Ultimate] Buff -> Increased weapon handling in both modes",
                    "[Ultimate] Buff -> Reduced Holster and Lower time from 0.5s to 0.4s",
                    "[Ultimate] Buff -> Reduced Deploy and Raise time from 1.5s to 1.3s",
                    "[Ultimate] Buff -> Default Normal scope magnification increased from 3x to 4x",
                    "[Perks] Removed -> Perk: Tactical Cooldown replaced",
                    "[Perks] New -> Perk: Herd Tracker: Pinging an enemy will track the entire team (Replaces Tactical Cooldown)"
                ]
            }
        ],
        "Conduit": [
            {
                "patch": "Overclocked Patch Notes (2026-05-04)",
                "details": [
                    "[Passive] New -> If Saviors Speed is active when sprinting toward a Skirmisher, gain an additional 5% movement speed.",
                    "[Tactical] Buff -> Split Charge has been incorporated into her base kit, granting two charges",
                    "[Tactical] Nerf -> Decreased Regen Duration from 9s to 6s",
                    "[Tactical] Nerf -> Decreased Regen from 20/s to 15/s",
                    "[Tactical] Buff -> Adjusted Cooldown to 27s (Standard Radiant Transfer was 32s, Split Charge was 21s)",
                    "[Tactical] Buff -> Removed cooldown start delay. The cooldown will now always begin after casting, even if still searching for a target",
                    "[Perks] Removed -> Radiant Transfer and Split Charge",
